{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54877","headline":"兵要望江南 占兽第二十（京本列第二十二，前六首另作「占牛马第十八」○三十四首） 二十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占兽第二十（京本列第二十二，前六首另作「占牛马第十八」○三十四首） 二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军营内，狗怪遣人猜（京本作「灾」）。\n急杀血流于戍（京本作「成」）地，埋深三尺以禳灾，敌将必擒来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}